WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.266 --> 00:00:06.466
Whoa, check it out!

2
00:00:06.533 --> 00:00:09.033
-I know, let's take a break here.

3
00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:10.233
Yeah, good idea.

4
00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:12.100
- Pika!
- Denne!

5
00:00:12.166 --> 00:00:14.466
Hey, wait.

6
00:00:14.533 --> 00:00:16.966
- Pika!
- Denne-ne!

7
00:00:20.866 --> 00:00:25.033
Yes. OK. Everybody out.

8
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:32.000
- It's time for a swim.
- And that includes you.

9
00:00:36.566 --> 00:00:40.433
Everybody, I want you all to meet my new friend Goomy,

10
00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:41.933
who's gonna be travelling with us.

11
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:44.366
- Say hi.
- Goomy, Goomy.

12
00:00:44.433 --> 00:00:46.733
- Frogdier-dier.
- Fletchinder.

13
00:00:48.533 --> 00:00:51.866
Chula.

14
00:00:51.933 --> 00:00:54.233
Pancham, cham-cham.

15
00:00:54.300 --> 00:00:55.766
- Che.
- Cham-cham.

16
00:00:55.833 --> 00:00:58.266
Be careful, you two.

17
00:00:58.333 --> 00:01:01.100
Watch for Goomy's horns, they're actually quite sensitive.

18
00:01:01.166 --> 00:01:03.100
- Bunnelby.
- Lux, Luxio.

19
00:01:03.166 --> 00:01:05.966
- Denne-ne, denne.
- Goomy!

20
00:01:06.033 --> 00:01:08.500
Dedenne still freaks Goomy out.

21
00:01:08.566 --> 00:01:11.666
Dragon types are weak against Fairy-type moves,

22
00:01:11.733 --> 00:01:14.466
but maybe something else is going on.

23
00:01:14.533 --> 00:01:17.466
I really wish you and Dedenne could become friends.

24
00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:21.800
♪ You're just a kid on a quest ♪

25
00:01:21.866 --> 00:01:23.566
♪ To be the best of the best ♪

26
00:01:23.633 --> 00:01:27.000
♪ Someday you're destined for power and glory ♪

27
00:01:27.066 --> 00:01:28.466
♪ You know you're up to the test ♪

28
00:01:28.533 --> 00:01:32.300
♪ There's only one way to tell this story ♪

29
00:01:32.366 --> 00:01:35.566
♪ Be a hero! Be a hero! ♪

30
00:01:35.633 --> 00:01:38.433
♪ All the power is at your command ♪

31
00:01:38.500 --> 00:01:42.966
♪ Face your fears and show you're a hero ♪

32
00:01:43.033 --> 00:01:47.666
♪ The future of the world is in your hand! ♪

33
00:01:47.733 --> 00:01:49.933
♪ Pokémon! ♪

34
00:01:53.266 --> 00:01:55.500
One for the Goomy!

35
00:01:59.033 --> 00:02:02.133
During their journey to Coumarine City,

36
00:02:02.200 --> 00:02:07.400
our heroes have found a lovely setting for a little rest and relaxation.

37
00:02:07.466 --> 00:02:09.133
-Pikachu!

38
00:02:12.200 --> 00:02:14.800
Pikachu!

39
00:02:15.100 --> 00:02:16.100
Pika?

40
00:02:20.100 --> 00:02:22.033
-What's going on?

41
00:02:25.600 --> 00:02:28.100
- Ah, Pikachu!
- Chespin!

42
00:02:28.166 --> 00:02:29.133
What's happening?

43
00:02:29.200 --> 00:02:31.800
Prepare for trouble, we're happening, of course!

44
00:02:31.866 --> 00:02:34.133
Your number one cause of twerpish remorse!

45
00:02:34.200 --> 00:02:36.633
To protect the world from devastation!

46
00:02:36.700 --> 00:02:39.433
To unite all people within our nation!

47
00:02:39.500 --> 00:02:42.433
To denounce the evils of truth and love!

48
00:02:42.500 --> 00:02:45.900
While you wait below, we swoop in from above!

49
00:02:45.966 --> 00:02:48.500
- Jessie!
- And James.

50
00:02:48.566 --> 00:02:51.266
Team Rocket blasts off at the speed of light!

51
00:02:51.333 --> 00:02:54.266
Surrender now, or prepare for one cagey fight!

52
00:02:54.333 --> 00:02:57.733
- Meowth, that's right!
- Wobbuffet!

53
00:02:58.933 --> 00:03:01.600
Team Rocket!

54
00:03:01.666 --> 00:03:03.633
Nothing succeeds like success.

55
00:03:03.700 --> 00:03:06.733
When it comes to conjurin' up traps, I'm the best.

56
00:03:06.800 --> 00:03:08.300
I helped the conjuring.

57
00:03:08.366 --> 00:03:10.966
All right, Pikachu, use Thunderbolt.

58
00:03:11.033 --> 00:03:13.066
Pika! Pika!

59
00:03:13.133 --> 00:03:16.333
'Kay, Inkay, stop them with Psybeam!

60
00:03:16.400 --> 00:03:18.133
Inkay!

61
00:03:21.433 --> 00:03:26.033
- Chespin, Pin Missile, go.
- Chespin!

62
00:03:26.100 --> 00:03:27.833
Wobbuffet, now!

63
00:03:27.900 --> 00:03:29.833
Wobbuffet!

64
00:03:32.400 --> 00:03:34.500
Now, give them another Psybeam.

65
00:03:34.566 --> 00:03:36.666
Inkay!

66
00:03:36.733 --> 00:03:39.433
Kay! Kay! Kay!

67
00:03:39.500 --> 00:03:40.566
-Pika!

68
00:03:41.933 --> 00:03:45.400
- Ah!
- Lotad and Lombre!

69
00:03:49.433 --> 00:03:53.233
I have the feeling we might've stumbled upon the Lombre's home.

70
00:03:53.300 --> 00:03:54.833
What are they doing?

71
00:03:59.766 --> 00:04:02.766
Aaah-aah-aah!

72
00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:08.200
A balloon blast off!

73
00:04:11.333 --> 00:04:13.800
Uh, OK. Let's get moving.

74
00:04:13.866 --> 00:04:15.500
Hurry, everybody.

75
00:04:16.966 --> 00:04:19.733
Cham! Cham! Cham!

76
00:04:29.300 --> 00:04:32.666
That was too close.

77
00:04:32.733 --> 00:04:34.233
- Is everyone OK?
- Cham, cham.

78
00:04:34.300 --> 00:04:36.300
- Wait, where's Ash?
- Goo, goo, goo!

79
00:04:36.366 --> 00:04:38.666
Yeah and where's Clemont?

80
00:04:38.733 --> 00:04:39.800
- Huh? Uh-oh.
- Uh.

81
00:04:39.866 --> 00:04:43.533
- Meowth! What are you doing here?
- Twerpette! What are you doing here?

82
00:04:43.600 --> 00:04:45.133
Huh, it's your fault.

83
00:04:45.200 --> 00:04:47.833
You got us into this yucky situation, remember?

84
00:04:47.900 --> 00:04:51.400
'Kay. My bad. I take full responsibility.

85
00:04:51.466 --> 00:04:53.966
I'll hang out with you guys and do everything I can

86
00:04:54.033 --> 00:04:55.333
to help find your buddies.

87
00:04:55.400 --> 00:04:57.233
And when they do come back,

88
00:04:57.300 --> 00:05:00.666
we'll grab every last twerp Pokémon we can catch and carry.

89
00:05:00.733 --> 00:05:04.400
Then we'll use all of them as bait to catch Pikachu!

90
00:05:04.466 --> 00:05:06.566
Uh-huh?

91
00:05:06.633 --> 00:05:10.400
Hey, I'm serious. I've got a strong sense of responsibility.

92
00:05:10.466 --> 00:05:13.633
We need to find Ash and Clemont as quick as we can.

93
00:05:13.700 --> 00:05:15.866
- Hm.
- Let's hurry.

94
00:05:15.933 --> 00:05:19.566
- My! Goomy!
- Huh?

95
00:05:23.633 --> 00:05:27.000
Ah. How is everyone?

96
00:05:27.066 --> 00:05:28.800
Bonnie? She's not here.

97
00:05:28.866 --> 00:05:31.933
- Serena's not either.
- Pika, pika.

98
00:05:32.000 --> 00:05:34.033
Hm, we've gotta find 'em.

99
00:05:34.100 --> 00:05:36.466
All right, Frogadier and Hawlucha, return.

100
00:05:36.533 --> 00:05:40.000
OK, Chespin and Luxio, you return too.

101
00:05:43.666 --> 00:05:46.733
Fletchinder, go look for Serena and Bonnie from the air.

102
00:05:46.800 --> 00:05:48.866
Fletch. Fletchinder.

103
00:05:50.300 --> 00:05:53.366
- Fennekin.
- Pika, pika.

104
00:05:53.433 --> 00:05:56.333
Fletchinder will find them both. Don't worry.

105
00:05:56.400 --> 00:05:59.366
- Kay, let's go.
- Pika!

106
00:06:03.500 --> 00:06:05.800
Come on, where is Meowth?

107
00:06:05.866 --> 00:06:09.633
- Should we go into search mode?
- I don't think we have a choice.

108
00:06:13.333 --> 00:06:15.766
Goo...

109
00:06:15.833 --> 00:06:17.866
- Goomy...
- Pancham.

110
00:06:17.933 --> 00:06:19.000
Goomy.

111
00:06:19.066 --> 00:06:20.633
-Goomy, what's wrong?

112
00:06:20.700 --> 00:06:22.366
Maybe Goomy's hungry.

113
00:06:22.433 --> 00:06:25.000
Hey, it wasn't walking, so what's its problem?

114
00:06:25.066 --> 00:06:28.500
- I'll go and find it some leaves to eat!
- Denne-ne.

115
00:06:28.566 --> 00:06:30.566
OK.

116
00:06:30.633 --> 00:06:33.300
- You mean it eats leaves off of trees?
- Uh-huh.

117
00:06:33.366 --> 00:06:35.366
Cha! Pancham!

118
00:06:37.633 --> 00:06:39.733
- Goo?
- Cham?

119
00:06:39.800 --> 00:06:42.333
Pancham!

120
00:06:42.400 --> 00:06:44.733
I found some!

121
00:06:49.800 --> 00:06:53.733
Whoa. Goomy's saying Dedenne freaks it out big time.

122
00:06:53.800 --> 00:06:57.866
- Wait. Dedenne's really nice, you know.
- Denne-ne.

123
00:06:57.933 --> 00:07:01.833
I wish we could do something to help those two get along.

124
00:07:01.900 --> 00:07:05.033
- Me too.
- Ne.

125
00:07:07.500 --> 00:07:10.400
Serena, where are you?

126
00:07:10.466 --> 00:07:13.933
Bonnie, say something so I know where you are!

127
00:07:14.000 --> 00:07:18.066
- Pika, Pika!
- Fennekin! Fenne!

128
00:07:18.133 --> 00:07:19.433
Pikachu?

129
00:07:19.500 --> 00:07:22.166
Huh?

130
00:07:22.233 --> 00:07:25.166
Pika, pika!

131
00:07:25.233 --> 00:07:29.100
You're sending that electricity out to Dedenne, aren't you?

132
00:07:29.166 --> 00:07:31.166
- Pikachu.
- Awesome. Great idea.

133
00:07:36.366 --> 00:07:37.733
- Denne!
- Dedenne?

134
00:07:37.800 --> 00:07:41.966
- Dedenne, did you feel something?
- Must've been Pikachu's electricity.

135
00:07:42.033 --> 00:07:43.833
Denne, denne-ne! Ah!

136
00:07:43.900 --> 00:07:45.666
Denne-ne!

137
00:07:45.733 --> 00:07:47.666
Aaah!

138
00:07:47.733 --> 00:07:48.800
- Huh?
- Pikachu.

139
00:07:48.866 --> 00:07:51.500
Did you get an answer back from Dedenne, Pikachu?

140
00:07:51.566 --> 00:07:54.233
- Pikachu.
- Hah!

141
00:07:57.433 --> 00:08:01.733
Oy, vey. If the twerps and their Pokémon have a reunion out here,

142
00:08:01.800 --> 00:08:03.200
our plan is completely kaput!

143
00:08:03.266 --> 00:08:04.433
Eureka!

144
00:08:04.500 --> 00:08:08.066
You know, pal, you're such a cutie pie.

145
00:08:11.633 --> 00:08:16.133
- What are you doing?
- I translate electricity too!

146
00:08:16.200 --> 00:08:17.300
Wow, you do?

147
00:08:19.266 --> 00:08:21.300
Those dopes'll believe anything!

148
00:08:21.366 --> 00:08:26.233
- So now what?
- Uh... This way. Follow me.

149
00:08:27.500 --> 00:08:29.100
- Denne-ne.
- Yeah.

150
00:08:29.166 --> 00:08:31.600
Dedenne agrees with me that it's this way too.

151
00:08:31.666 --> 00:08:33.833
Yay, that's great.

152
00:08:38.533 --> 00:08:41.966
- I don't see them anywhere.
- Then where are they?

153
00:08:42.033 --> 00:08:44.466
- Pika, Pika.
- Fennekin.

154
00:08:48.533 --> 00:08:49.933
Pancham, cham, cham. Pancham.

155
00:08:50.000 --> 00:08:51.833
Hey, Pancham would appreciate it

156
00:08:51.900 --> 00:08:54.633
- if you'd stop messin' with its ear.
- Pancham! Pancham!

157
00:08:54.700 --> 00:08:57.400
While you're at it, stop munchin' on the sunglasses.

158
00:08:57.466 --> 00:09:00.533
- See, they were a gift from Serena.
- Incredible.

159
00:09:00.600 --> 00:09:03.666
With you here, we know exactly what our Pokémon are saying.

160
00:09:03.733 --> 00:09:06.533
Hey, how do you know how to talk like people too?

161
00:09:06.600 --> 00:09:08.900
Now there's a most excellent question.

162
00:09:08.966 --> 00:09:11.533
But the answer to that question is a long story.

163
00:09:11.600 --> 00:09:14.266
- First...
- Why don't we just drop it instead?

164
00:09:14.333 --> 00:09:16.866
But why did you even ask me in the first place?

165
00:09:16.933 --> 00:09:18.900
-Inkay.

166
00:09:18.966 --> 00:09:20.266
Huh... Ah!

167
00:09:20.333 --> 00:09:22.800
- That was Inkay!
- And that means...

168
00:09:22.866 --> 00:09:25.133
Hey!

169
00:09:25.200 --> 00:09:28.800
- Team Rocket!
- Yes. In the flesh.

170
00:09:28.866 --> 00:09:31.800
-What took you so long? Yay!

171
00:09:31.866 --> 00:09:34.966
So where have you been, you little scamp?

172
00:09:35.033 --> 00:09:37.033
We're wondering what took you so long.

173
00:09:37.100 --> 00:09:39.666
Although it appears you've got a present for us.

174
00:09:39.733 --> 00:09:43.766
Pancham, Goomy and Dedenne. Twerpettes to boot.

175
00:09:43.833 --> 00:09:46.533
And separated from the other twerps as well.

176
00:09:46.600 --> 00:09:49.333
Now's our chance for a little Pokémon picking.

177
00:09:49.400 --> 00:09:51.600
You tricked us. You were lying.

178
00:09:51.666 --> 00:09:55.833
Wow, if you believed my malarkey, then I've got a bridge to sell ya.

179
00:09:55.900 --> 00:09:58.066
Huh?

180
00:09:58.133 --> 00:10:00.566
Bonnie, I think you'd better step back.

181
00:10:00.633 --> 00:10:03.200
- Ka.
- Ooh, the brave twerpette goes solo.

182
00:10:03.266 --> 00:10:04.933
Brave but foolhardy.

183
00:10:05.000 --> 00:10:07.566
You don't stand a chance without Pikachu protection.

184
00:10:07.633 --> 00:10:10.000
I'm not gonna let you attack my friends.

185
00:10:10.066 --> 00:10:12.233
Now, Pancham, you ready to go?

186
00:10:12.300 --> 00:10:15.666
Pancham, cham.

187
00:10:16.700 --> 00:10:19.966
Cham. Pancham, cham!

188
00:10:21.066 --> 00:10:23.700
Who's that Pokémon?

189
00:10:27.100 --> 00:10:29.700
It's Lotad.

190
00:10:29.766 --> 00:10:31.633
Lotad.

191
00:10:35.100 --> 00:10:36.366
Shadow Ball, go!

192
00:10:38.433 --> 00:10:40.500
Pancham, dodge!

193
00:10:40.566 --> 00:10:42.000
Cham! Pan!

194
00:10:42.066 --> 00:10:44.733
- Inkay, Psybeam!
- Inkay!

195
00:10:44.800 --> 00:10:47.066
Cham!

196
00:10:47.133 --> 00:10:49.133
- Pancham, are you OK?
- Pancham.

197
00:10:49.200 --> 00:10:53.133
- Good. Stone Edge!
- Pancham!

198
00:10:55.566 --> 00:10:59.766
- Way to go, Pancham!
- Looking great, Pancham!

199
00:10:59.833 --> 00:11:03.300
- Ugh! Pumpkaboo, Dark Pulse!
- Pumpkaboo!

200
00:11:03.366 --> 00:11:06.066
- Dodge it, now.
- Cham!

201
00:11:06.133 --> 00:11:08.000
- Inkay, Tackle!
- Inkay!

202
00:11:08.066 --> 00:11:11.000
- Inkay!
- Pancham, cham!

203
00:11:11.066 --> 00:11:13.233
- Are you all right?
- Pancham, cham.

204
00:11:13.300 --> 00:11:16.200
Bring the curtain down on this sham with Shadow Ball.

205
00:11:16.266 --> 00:11:18.900
-Dodge it, quick!

206
00:11:18.966 --> 00:11:20.766
Pancham!

207
00:11:20.833 --> 00:11:23.933
- Pancham, no!
- Goo! Goo, Goomy!

208
00:11:31.266 --> 00:11:34.266
-Cham!

209
00:11:34.333 --> 00:11:38.266
- You can do it, Pancham.
- How can shorty still be standing?

210
00:11:38.333 --> 00:11:40.533
Now, Pancham. Show them your Dark Pulse.

211
00:11:40.600 --> 00:11:43.566
- Pancham!
- Inkay!

212
00:11:43.633 --> 00:11:44.533
Oh, no! Inkay!

213
00:11:44.600 --> 00:11:46.200
- Way to go!
- Yeah!

214
00:11:46.266 --> 00:11:48.100
- Inkay, Psybeam!
- Inkay!

215
00:11:50.000 --> 00:11:52.533
Pancham, you've gotta hang in there.

216
00:11:52.600 --> 00:11:53.833
Oh, no, you're confused.

217
00:11:53.900 --> 00:11:57.833
I hate to break the news, but you can't win a battle all by your lonesome.

218
00:11:57.900 --> 00:12:01.533
- Denne, denne!
- Ah? Dedenne!

219
00:12:01.600 --> 00:12:04.233
-Cham, cham, cham.

220
00:12:04.300 --> 00:12:06.266
- Pancham, Pancham.
- Denne-ne.

221
00:12:06.333 --> 00:12:09.200
- Pancham, you're all right.
- Pancham, cham.

222
00:12:09.266 --> 00:12:10.966
- Cham, cham.
- Denne.

223
00:12:11.033 --> 00:12:15.733
- No! And things were going so wonderfully.
- But the outcome will still be the same.

224
00:12:15.800 --> 00:12:18.366
- All right, Dark Pulse.
- Kaboo!

225
00:12:18.433 --> 00:12:20.300
Pancham, cham! Pancham.

226
00:12:23.900 --> 00:12:26.066
My, my, my.

227
00:12:26.133 --> 00:12:28.600
- Dedenne, use Thunder Shock.
- De!

228
00:12:30.433 --> 00:12:33.600
- Ha, ha.
- All right, Pancham, Arm Thrust!

229
00:12:33.666 --> 00:12:35.133
Cham! Pan!

230
00:12:35.200 --> 00:12:36.633
- Kay!
- Cham!

231
00:12:36.700 --> 00:12:39.300
Now, Dedenne, use Tackle.

232
00:12:39.833 --> 00:12:40.833
Denne!

233
00:12:40.900 --> 00:12:43.866
- Pancham, use Stone Edge.
- Pancham!

234
00:12:47.033 --> 00:12:49.766
- Dedenne, Nuzzle!
- Ne-ne-ne-ne-ne-ne-ne!

235
00:12:52.400 --> 00:12:53.900
Oh, Pumpkaboo!

236
00:12:53.966 --> 00:12:56.700
- That's showing 'em, Dedenne!
- Let's go. Dark Pulse!

237
00:12:56.766 --> 00:12:58.666
Pancham!

238
00:13:02.900 --> 00:13:04.066
- Zip.
- Zero.

239
00:13:04.133 --> 00:13:08.633
- Na-da! Ta-ta!
- Wobbuffet!

240
00:13:08.700 --> 00:13:12.466
- You did it, Serena.
- Thanks, Bonnie, but we did it.

241
00:13:12.533 --> 00:13:15.700
How are you doing, Goomy? Hey, where's Goomy?

242
00:13:15.766 --> 00:13:20.100
It was just here a minute ago. Goomy? Come out!

243
00:13:20.166 --> 00:13:23.300
- Where are you?
- Pancham, Pan. Cham, cham.

244
00:13:27.366 --> 00:13:30.200
- What's that?
- I think they're Goomy's tracks.

245
00:13:30.266 --> 00:13:33.800
Let's follow them and find Goomy.

246
00:13:33.866 --> 00:13:35.300
Denne-ne-ne!

247
00:13:35.366 --> 00:13:39.800
- Dedenne's gonna find Goomy, no doubt.
- Thank you very much, Dedenne.

248
00:13:41.633 --> 00:13:43.900
Cham, Pancham, Pancham.

249
00:13:47.966 --> 00:13:51.333
- Poor Goomy.
- It couldn't have gone that far by now.

250
00:13:51.400 --> 00:13:52.766
- Denne-ne!
- Huh?

251
00:13:52.833 --> 00:13:54.300
Denne, denne!

252
00:13:54.366 --> 00:13:59.166
- Huh? In that little place?
- Goomy's body is really soft.

253
00:13:59.233 --> 00:14:01.866
- Dedenne?
- Denne-ne-ne.

254
00:14:01.933 --> 00:14:03.733
Ne!

255
00:14:03.800 --> 00:14:05.000
Good luck.

256
00:14:05.066 --> 00:14:08.166
Ne, ne, ne, ne, ne, ne, ne.

257
00:14:08.233 --> 00:14:10.366
Denne. Ne-ne-ne.

258
00:14:11.066 --> 00:14:12.100
Denne!

259
00:14:14.166 --> 00:14:16.100
Denne-ne-ne-ne!

260
00:14:16.666 --> 00:14:19.100
Denne-ne. Ne-ne.

261
00:14:22.533 --> 00:14:26.566
We've somehow got to grab the twerps' Pokémon before they reunite.

262
00:14:26.633 --> 00:14:29.200
We will. No twerp gets one over on me three times.

263
00:14:29.266 --> 00:14:30.700
Wobba, wobba.

264
00:14:30.766 --> 00:14:32.733
Ah, we need a plan.

265
00:14:32.800 --> 00:14:35.333
Right now, they're probably... Uh, gross!

266
00:14:35.400 --> 00:14:39.300
- I just sat on something slimy.
- Ew! Hey, is that the twerp's...

267
00:14:41.700 --> 00:14:44.100
-Why, you slimeball!

268
00:14:44.166 --> 00:14:46.666
- Quit being so slick!
- Wobbuffet.

269
00:14:46.733 --> 00:14:50.233
- Wait!
- Stop!

270
00:14:52.666 --> 00:14:55.200
Fletchinder!

271
00:14:55.266 --> 00:14:58.533
- We're down here!
- Go tell Ash and Clemont!

272
00:14:58.600 --> 00:15:01.266
Tinder. Fle!

273
00:15:04.100 --> 00:15:05.600
Ash! Clemont!

274
00:15:05.666 --> 00:15:07.566
Serena! Bonnie!

275
00:15:07.633 --> 00:15:08.966
- Are you OK?
- Yeah.

276
00:15:09.033 --> 00:15:12.100
- Everybody here is just fine.
- Ah, thank goodness.

277
00:15:12.166 --> 00:15:13.600
Fennekin.

278
00:15:13.666 --> 00:15:16.200
- I'm so glad you're OK too, Fennekin.
- Kin.

279
00:15:16.266 --> 00:15:21.233
I'm really sorry, Ash. But somehow, we got separated from Goomy.

280
00:15:21.300 --> 00:15:23.333
- Huh?
- It's not Serena's fault!

281
00:15:23.400 --> 00:15:27.100
Serena battled really, really hard against Team Rocket to protect us

282
00:15:27.166 --> 00:15:30.333
- and that's about the time Goomy ran off.
- Cham, cham.

283
00:15:30.400 --> 00:15:34.433
Wow, so Serena protected you? I can't thank you enough.

284
00:15:34.500 --> 00:15:37.833
I'm guessing Goomy ran off like that because it was really scared.

285
00:15:37.900 --> 00:15:41.566
- Pikachu.
- So let's all search for Goomy. Now!

286
00:15:41.633 --> 00:15:44.200
Dedenne went inside some rocks looking for it.

287
00:15:44.266 --> 00:15:45.500
Whoa, really?

288
00:15:45.566 --> 00:15:48.233
Fletchinder, go search the area by those rocks.

289
00:15:48.300 --> 00:15:50.666
Fletchinder, fletch.

290
00:15:55.066 --> 00:15:59.433
Mm. Here! Goomy can eventually evolve into a Goodra.

291
00:15:59.500 --> 00:16:01.766
Goodra. Well, what do you know?

292
00:16:01.833 --> 00:16:04.000
Perhaps we could make good use out of it.

293
00:16:04.066 --> 00:16:05.866
Looks powerful.

294
00:16:05.933 --> 00:16:08.133
So while we're here, we'll make the catch.

295
00:16:08.200 --> 00:16:10.733
- Then Pikachu, natch.
- Wob, wob, wob!

296
00:16:16.300 --> 00:16:19.866
Quit squirming, you slime sack. Ah.

297
00:16:20.933 --> 00:16:23.233
Pumpkaboo, let's calm down that bag of nerves.

298
00:16:23.300 --> 00:16:27.500
With Shadow Ball!

299
00:16:29.933 --> 00:16:32.266
What? No counter-attack?

300
00:16:32.333 --> 00:16:36.033
Well, I've heard Goomy's the weakest of all Dragon-type Pokémon.

301
00:16:36.100 --> 00:16:38.400
My?

302
00:16:40.200 --> 00:16:41.933
-Uh? Aaah!

303
00:16:42.000 --> 00:16:46.566
- What's with the downpour? Ah!
- Goomy's Rain Dance.

304
00:16:48.300 --> 00:16:52.466
It takes forever to blow-dry all of this hair. Aah! Ugh.

305
00:16:52.533 --> 00:16:56.866
You are going to pay dearly for this. Now, Pumpkaboo, use Shadow Ball.

306
00:17:01.366 --> 00:17:03.966
-Denne, denne!

307
00:17:04.033 --> 00:17:07.466
- Who's that?
- It hangs with the twerpette.

308
00:17:07.533 --> 00:17:11.733
- Then perhaps we should pick a pair.
- Which will plop Pikachu into our laps.

309
00:17:11.800 --> 00:17:13.766
- OK, Inkay, Tackle.
- Ink!

310
00:17:13.833 --> 00:17:16.266
Denne.

311
00:17:17.200 --> 00:17:19.000
Denne!

312
00:17:19.066 --> 00:17:21.333
Take care of that pest.

313
00:17:21.400 --> 00:17:22.933
Wobbuffet!

314
00:17:23.000 --> 00:17:24.566
Denne! Ne!

315
00:17:24.633 --> 00:17:27.000
Goo! Goomy!

316
00:17:27.066 --> 00:17:30.200
All right, Goomy first. Hah!

317
00:17:30.266 --> 00:17:32.933
- Ne!
- Goomy! Goo!

318
00:17:33.000 --> 00:17:36.300
Ah! Enough already! Use Shadow Ball!

319
00:17:38.066 --> 00:17:40.833
- Denne!
- Goomy!

320
00:17:41.400 --> 00:17:43.166
-Denne, denne!

321
00:17:43.233 --> 00:17:45.433
Use Tackle!

322
00:17:45.500 --> 00:17:48.333
- Ink, ink, ink!
- Goo! Goo! Goo!

323
00:17:48.400 --> 00:17:53.300
- Nenne-ne.
- Goomy!

324
00:17:53.366 --> 00:17:55.266
- Shadow Ball, again!
- Pumpkaboo!

325
00:17:55.333 --> 00:18:00.300
- Goo!
- Denne-ne-ne! Denne!

326
00:18:00.366 --> 00:18:04.133
Time for the last chorus. Pumpkaboo, Dark Pulse.

327
00:18:04.200 --> 00:18:06.133
Kaboo!

328
00:18:06.200 --> 00:18:08.033
Hm!

329
00:18:08.100 --> 00:18:10.566
Huh? Since when did you become brave?

330
00:18:10.633 --> 00:18:11.933
Inkay, Tackle!

331
00:18:12.000 --> 00:18:14.766
- Kay! Kay! Kay! Kay! Kay!
- Goo! Goo! Goo!

332
00:18:14.833 --> 00:18:18.266
Goomy!

333
00:18:19.966 --> 00:18:23.000
Aah!

334
00:18:23.066 --> 00:18:25.333
Fletch! Fletchinder!

335
00:18:26.800 --> 00:18:29.333
- Fletchinder, did you find them?
- Fletchinder.

336
00:18:31.266 --> 00:18:32.833
- That cloud.
- Huh?

337
00:18:32.900 --> 00:18:35.900
Return, Fletchinder, and thanks!

338
00:18:35.966 --> 00:18:38.066
'Kay, let's hurry!

339
00:18:42.133 --> 00:18:45.300
So Goomy's quite an accomplished slimy rainmaker.

340
00:18:45.366 --> 00:18:47.533
Goo, Goomy, goo.

341
00:18:48.600 --> 00:18:52.100
- But this time, we're not gonna miss.
- Goo, goo, Goomy.

342
00:18:52.166 --> 00:18:54.600
And go!

343
00:18:57.833 --> 00:19:00.533
Come on.

344
00:19:00.600 --> 00:19:03.233
- Dedenne!
- It's all right, Goomy.

345
00:19:03.300 --> 00:19:07.233
- Now you leave the rest to us.
- We'll see about that, twerp.

346
00:19:07.300 --> 00:19:09.600
Hand over Pikachu and no one gets hurt.

347
00:19:09.666 --> 00:19:12.233
- Bunnelby, Mud Shot, let's do it.
- By!

348
00:19:12.300 --> 00:19:14.733
Bunnelby!

349
00:19:14.833 --> 00:19:16.733
Kay!

350
00:19:16.800 --> 00:19:18.466
Pancham, Stone Edge!

351
00:19:18.533 --> 00:19:21.366
Pancham!

352
00:19:24.233 --> 00:19:26.833
All right, Pikachu, use Thunderbolt.

353
00:19:26.900 --> 00:19:29.300
Pika, Pikachu!

354
00:19:33.500 --> 00:19:36.666
- We're blasting off again!
- Wobbuffet!

355
00:19:36.733 --> 00:19:39.266
- Pumpkaboo!
- Inkay!

356
00:19:39.333 --> 00:19:43.000
- Dedenne, hang in there.
- Is it OK?

357
00:19:43.066 --> 00:19:45.033
Goo, Goomy.

358
00:19:45.100 --> 00:19:48.833
You don't have to worry one bit. I'll fix Dedenne right up.

359
00:19:48.900 --> 00:19:51.233
- Thank you, big brother.
- Hm.

360
00:19:52.366 --> 00:19:56.466
- Ne. Ne-ne.
- Goo, Goomy.

361
00:19:56.533 --> 00:19:58.466
- Looks like you're feeling better.
- Pika!

362
00:19:58.533 --> 00:19:59.833
Denne!

363
00:19:59.900 --> 00:20:03.633
Yay, Dedenne's fine! Dedenne's fine! Ha, ha.

364
00:20:03.700 --> 00:20:05.566
I'm so relieved.

365
00:20:05.633 --> 00:20:09.433
- Denne-ne!

366
00:20:09.500 --> 00:20:13.166
What do you know? Goomy isn't afraid of Dedenne any more.

367
00:20:13.233 --> 00:20:16.400
Yeah, and that's because they've turned into best buddies.

368
00:20:16.466 --> 00:20:18.666
I wonder what could've happened.

369
00:20:18.733 --> 00:20:21.133
Well, whatever happened, it's awesome.

370
00:20:21.200 --> 00:20:23.366
Cham, cham.

371
00:20:23.433 --> 00:20:24.800
Denne-ne-ne!

372
00:20:24.866 --> 00:20:26.200
- Goo!
- Denne-ne-ne-ne!

373
00:20:28.333 --> 00:20:30.100
Don't do that, please?

374
00:20:30.166 --> 00:20:33.433
-Denne!

375
00:20:33.933 --> 00:20:35.066
Denne-ne!

376
00:20:35.133 --> 00:20:38.766
Thanks to the bravery of two small but courageous Pokémon,

377
00:20:38.833 --> 00:20:43.166
our heroes are out of trouble and soon to be back on the road to Coumarine City,

378
00:20:43.233 --> 00:20:46.266
as the journey continues.
